from cp23b.replay
# Branch m6-turnback-giratina-defeated: Turnback Cave's Giratina knocked out
# by the story's team (battle auto). From cp23b's end (Snowpoint), set down in the room, as m6-turnback-giratina-caught is:
# "Giratina disappeared", hidden (the on-load's FLAG_MAP_LOCAL_REMOVE_OBJECT), not caught; the Hall of Fame shows it
# again (sys-hof-respawn).
# Kept setup: the warp into the Giratina room (the pillar rooms are off the chain; sys-turnback-routing).
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM 11 15 up
until idle 6000
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
battle auto 30000
+0 assert battle scripted platinum:SPECIES_GIRATINA won
advance text 20000
until idle 3000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_GIRATINA false
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM_GIRATINA true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_MAP_LOCAL_REMOVE_OBJECT false
+0 assert state party.length 5
